ock__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/41cd86aa-f6de-4624-bc9c-90ec921f0ed2_courier2.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Courier icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><!----><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Ensure DE&amp;I are prioritised and embedded into our ways of working<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/1a0913ed-3472-485b-8acb-6e42e6e3e83c_alert.svg?auto=compress,format" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Alert icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><!----><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Ensure risks of Modern Slavery in our operations are proactively mitigated<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg?auto=compress,format" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Success icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><!----><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Deliver positive contributions to the communities we work in<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="highlights" class="section-wrapper" index="2" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta card--no-image" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><!----><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Highlights</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our focus continues to be on &#39;delivering better&#39; for all stakeholders — and it&#39;s our people who make that happen. This year, we welcomed colleagues from DHL eCommerce UK and Coll‑8 into the newly formed Evri Group, and continued to invest in strengthening our culture, developing leadership capability, and ensuring every colleague feels supported, valued and able to be their best.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="3" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-5d43a0fc><div id="list_block" class="list-block__text-container" data-v-5d43a0fc><!----><!----></div><!--[--><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/41bf8079-3dd8-48b6-ad6b-013e68421339_above_and_beyond.svg?auto=compress,format" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Above and beyond icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><!----><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Workvivo remains our main two-way communications platform, accessible to all colleagues. Following the integration of new colleagues from DHL eCommerce UK and Coll‑8, our engagement rate for 2025/26 was 66.8%, and we&#39;re focused on further embedding the platform across our newly expanded workforce.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/d7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="default" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><!----><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our Courier Delivery App and Courier Community App continue to engage more couriers, now offering features like availability-based round offers, streamlined access to earnings, and — for our top performers — the ability to receive customer tips in full via a third party.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/896bc97f-8930-44c4-81da-b7f9f452fdec_delivered_with_care.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Delivered with care icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><!----><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our long-term partnership with Scope, the UK&#39;s biggest disability equality charity, continues to go from strength to strength. We&#39;ve raised £188,000 since the partnership began, supporting our ambition to become the UK&#39;s most accessible parcel delivery company.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="employee-wellbeing" class="section-wrapper" index="4" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7iwSZ7c43Q3gFNc_20220725-EVRI-People-Photography-471-1-a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7iwSZ7c43Q3gFNc_20220725-EVRI-People-Photography-471-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7iwSZ7c43Q3gFNc_20220725-EVRI-People-Photography-471-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7iwSZ7c43Q3gFNc_20220725-EVRI-People-Photography-471-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Employee Wellbeing</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri wants to remove the stigma attached to mental health and ensure it’s treated as equally as physical health. Our commitment is to create a workplace culture where everyone feels appreciated, is treated fairly, and has access to the support and resources they require.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We have more than 80 certified Mental Health First Aiders across the business who are trained to have confidential conversations about mental health and wellbeing. These qualified members of the team can recognise crucial warning signs of mental ill health and can guide those who need them to the appropriate support services.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We also have a dedicated health and wellbeing hub on Workvivo (our internal communications platform), providing information and guidance on available support services covering mental, financial and physical wellbeing. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Colleagues have 24/7 access to mental health resources and counselling through our Employee Assistance Programme, alongside enhanced occupational health support, early intervention pathways, and practical financial wellbeing tools. As part of our benefits offering, colleagues can also opt into flexible benefits — including dental insurance, a health cash plan, additional life assurance and a digital GP service offering same-day appointments.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="reward-and-recognition" class="section-wrapper" index="5" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7NibJ7c43Q3f3wE_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-474ee7b.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7NibJ7c43Q3f3wE_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-474.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C5%2C6240%2C4150&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7NibJ7c43Q3f3wE_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-474.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C5%2C6240%2C4150&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7NibJ7c43Q3f3wE_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-474.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C5%2C6240%2C4150&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri office worker is sat at his desk whilst another stands over him. They are both looking at their screen in amusement" width="1000" height="665" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Reward and recognition</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->All Evri colleagues have access to a range of benefits, including life assurance, pension, and free will-writing and legal services. Our recognition scheme, &#39;The Extra Mile Awards&#39;, is open to all colleagues, with winners awarded £100 gift cards, alongside local &#39;Colleague of the Month&#39; schemes and &#39;Evri Star Awards&#39; for our delivery teams.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="modern-slavery" class="section-wrapper" index="6" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/abmCQ7bci2UF6I6n_courier%2bholding%2bparcel%2band%2bwalking%2bdown%2bstreet2917.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/abmCQ7bci2UF6I6n_courier%2Bholding%2Bparcel%2Band%2Bwalking%2Bdown%2Bstreet.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C5%2C5000%2C3325&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/abmCQ7bci2UF6I6n_courier%2Bholding%2Bparcel%2Band%2Bwalking%2Bdown%2Bstreet.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C5%2C5000%2C3325&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/abmCQ7bci2UF6I6n_courier%2Bholding%2Bparcel%2Band%2Bwalking%2Bdown%2Bstreet.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C5%2C5000%2C3325&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Photo of a courier holding parcel and walking down street" width="1000" height="665" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Modern slavery</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our commitment to combatting Modern Slavery was reaffirmed through the renewal of our membership with Slave Free Alliance for an additional three years. Further internal processes were implemented to effectively escalate and manage potential Modern Slavery concerns within our operations, accompanied by comprehensive training for HR teams to adeptly handle any cases that arise. Additionally, a thorough review and update of our supplier and labour agency audit processes were undertaken, ensuring alignment with best practices and regulatory standards.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Significant strides were made in enhancing our internal audit procedures, with audits completed using an improved process. Additionally, our colleagues have completed our online training module on Modern Slavery, which has now been incorporated into the induction process for all new hires within our operations.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-See our modern slavery policy" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/modern-slavery" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.7C8.88 6.52 9.12 6.42 9.4 6.42C9.68 6.42 9.92 6.52 10.1 6.7L14.7 11.3C14.8 11.4 14.87 11.51 14.91 11.62C14.95 11.74 14.97 11.87 14.97 12C14.97 12.13 14.95 12.26 14.91 12.38C14.87 12.49 14.8 12.6 14.7 12.7L10.1 17.3C9.92 17.48 9.68 17.57 9.4 17.57C9.12 17.57 8.88 17.48 8.7 17.3C8.52 17.12 8.42 16.88 8.42 16.6C8.42 16.32 8.52 16.08 8.7 15.9L12.6 12Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div><!--]--></div><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> See our modern slavery policy<!--]--></span></a><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="diversity,-equity-&amp;-inclusion-(de&amp;i)" class="section-wrapper" index="7" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7irZJ7c43Q3gFG9_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10020a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7irZJ7c43Q3gFG9_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10020.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7irZJ7c43Q3gFG9_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10020.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7irZJ7c43Q3gFG9_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10020.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1799" height="1200" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Diversity, Equity &amp; Inclusion (DE&amp;I)</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our mission is to create an amazing place of work for everyone. One of the ways we underpin that commitment is through our diversity, equity and inclusion (DE&amp;I) strategy. We want to create positive, impactful and meaningful change, helping us to achieve our overall objective of building an environment that works for everyone, where every person can bring – and be – their whole selves.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We&#39;ve also launched employee networks, including LGBTQ+, neurodiversity, and parent/carer networks — all led by colleagues, with a director sponsor for each. This year, we launched a new <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->gender network for women in logistics<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, and continue to build networks that bring people together, raise awareness, and celebrate key diversity strands.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We took part in the Inclusive Employers Standard and received Silver status, we’re working towards <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Gold status<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> , building on our position as the first business in our industry to achieve this accreditation. In 2024, we launched our partnership with Scope, the UK&#39;s biggest disability equality charity, supporting our ambition to become the most accessible parcel delivery company in the UK, where 1 in 4 people are disabled and often rely on deliveries to maintain independence. We&#39;re now in the second year of this partnership, having raised £188,000 to date. In September and October 2025, we also funded a trial allowing people to donate items to Scope for free via our ParcelShops and lockers — generating high-quality stock and a more sustainable way to pass on unwanted items.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 