;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7Nksp7c43Q3f32K_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-345.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C5%2C5991%2C3984&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri corporate employee is delivering a presentation in a meeting room. They are stood in front of a large screen displaying some delivery statistics" width="1000" height="665" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Learning and development</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We continued to invest in developing capability across the business this year, launching <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Data and AI Academies<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> to build business-critical skills, and strengthening induction pathways for new starters in our operational depot locations. A Leadership Academy is set to launch in 2026/27, supporting the development of our existing management teams and future leaders.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="union-representation" class="section-wrapper" index="10" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7irfZ7c43Q3gFHG_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9407a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7irfZ7c43Q3gFHG_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9407.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7irfZ7c43Q3gFHG_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9407.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7irfZ7c43Q3gFHG_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9407.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1799" height="1200" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Union representation</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->At Evri, 68% of our employees are represented by an independent trade union (data correct as of October 2025). Each year, we conduct pay negotiations with our recognised trade unions, representing colleagues across our operational workforce.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="couriers" class="section-wrapper" index="11" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7irkp7c43Q3gFHJ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3608a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7irkp7c43Q3gFHJ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3608.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7irkp7c43Q3gFHJ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3608.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7irkp7c43Q3gFHJ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3608.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1799" height="1200" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Couriers</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri&#39;s self-employed courier network provides work for up to <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->28,000 couriers<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, working with Evri in a way that works for them. All our couriers earn above the National Living Wage, averaging more than <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->£20 per hour<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our courier offer — now known as <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri Plus<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> — is backed by the <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->GMB union<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, and remains a market-leading model that provides additional benefits to eligible couriers while preserving the flexibility of self-employment. Evri Plus couriers benefit from guaranteed rates of pay, paid holiday, pension provision, parental leave, and access to additional payments for non-parcel delivery tasks.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->This year, we expanded Evri Plus further to include optional specialist insurance, covering couriers financially if they&#39;re unable to work due to accident or sickness, along with a death and permanent disability benefit should they be involved in a serious accident while delivering for Evri.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We&#39;ve also continued to develop our partnership with <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Onsi<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, giving couriers access to a digital GP, digital physiotherapy, counselling services and shopping discounts — used by 19,400 couriers last year, supporting their physical, mental and financial wellbeing.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->In May 2025, we launched a <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Courier EV support scheme<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, helping couriers switch to electric vehicles with financial support towards running costs and charging infrastructure.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="charity-work" data-slice="FeatureBanner" class="feature-banner feature-banner--pt-0 feature-banner--pb-0" index="12" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__container" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__content" data-v-054940bd><!----><h2 class="feature-banner__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-054940bd>Charity Work</h2><div class="feature-banner__text" data-v-054940bd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our long-term partnership with Scope, the UK&#39;s biggest disability equality charity, continues to go from strength to strength. We raised £160,000 in the first year of the partnership, and a further £28,000 since year two began in October 2025 — <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->£188,000 raised in total<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->. We were also delighted to sponsor the 2025 Scope Awards, celebrating the achievements of disabled people across many industries.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Beyond Scope, we&#39;ve broadened our community partnerships this year:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A new partnership with <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Big Issue Recruit<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, supporting people who face barriers to sustainable employment with work placements.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Support for the charity <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Go Beyond<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, delivering Christmas gifts to disadvantaged children free of charge in December 2025.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Continued sponsorship of <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Leeds Pride<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> as Platinum Sponsor and Sustainability Sponsor, and support for Disability Pride Month.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A new partnership with <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Mencap<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, offering hands-on work experience for people with special educational needs and disabilities (SEND) — with our Heathrow location receiving an Employer of the Month award from Mencap for its support.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We&#39;re also now in our second year of giving all permanent colleagues <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->one paid day of leave each year<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> to volunteer and support local communities and charities, and colleagues can give through our payroll charitable giving scheme, with donations made before tax and eligible for match funding.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We&#39;ve continued to raise awareness of NHS blood donation across the Group too, with more than 40 colleague donors to date, helping save an estimated 126 lives.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----></div><div class="feature-banner__image" data-v-054940bd><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7iwQ57c43Q3gFNY_20220725-EVRI-People-Photography-464-copya942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7iwQ57c43Q3gFNY_20220725-EVRI-People-Photography-464-copy.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7iwQ57c43Q3gFNY_20220725-EVRI-People-Photography-464-copy.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7iwQ57c43Q3gFNY_20220725-EVRI-People-Photography-464-copy.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-054940bd></div><!----></div></section><section id="feature_link_cards" class="section-wrapper feature-link-cards feature-link-cards--pt" index="13" data-v-5ebb0713 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><div class="feature-link-cards__cards" data-v-5ebb0713><!--[--><a href="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/55aYZ-f9q_KTUzKc_EV0862-ESGReport2025_26.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-test-id="e-link-card" class="e-link-card e-link-card--small-on-desktop e-link-card--href feature-link-cards__card" data-v-5ebb0713 data-v-92810816><div class="e-link-card__left" data-v-92810816><!----><div data-v-92810816><div class="e-link-card__title" data-test-id="e-link-card-title" data-v-92810816>Our ESG Report <!----></div><div class="e-link-card__description" data-test-id="e-link-card-description" data-v-92810816><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="e-icon e-link-card__right-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_circle_right" data-test-id="chevron_circle_right" data-v-92810816 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.68 12L10.3 14.38C10.12 14.56 10.03 14.79 10.03 15.06C10.03 15.34 10.12 15.57 10.3 15.78C10.5 15.97 10.74 16.07 11.01 16.07C11.29 16.07 11.53 15.97 11.72 15.78L14.8 12.7C15 12.5 15.1 12.27 15.1 12C15.1 11.73 15 11.5 14.8 11.3L11.7 8.2C11.5 8 11.27 7.9 11 7.91C10.73 7.92 10.5 8.03 10.3 8.22C10.12 8.43 10.02 8.66 10.01 8.93C10 9.19 10.1 9.43 10.3 9.62L12.68 12ZM12 22C10.62 22 9.32 21.74 8.1 21.21C6.88 20.69 5.83 19.98 4.92 19.07C4.03 18.18 3.31 17.12 2.79 15.9C2.26 14.68 2 13.38 2 12C2 10.62 2.26 9.32 2.79 8.1C3.31 6.88 4.03 5.83 4.92 4.92C5.83 4.03 6.88 3.31 8.1 2.79C9.32 2.26 10.62 2 12 2C13.38 2 14.68 2.26 15.9 2.79C17.12 3.31 18.18 4.03 19.07 4.92C19.98 5.83 20.69 6.88 21.21 8.1C21.74 9.32 22 10.62 22 12C22 13.38 21.74 14.68 21.21 15.9C20.69 17.12 19.98 18.18 19.07 19.07C18.18 19.98 17.12 20.69 15.9 21.21C14.68 21.74 13.38 22 12 22ZM12 20C14.23 20 16.12 19.23 17.68 17.68C19.23 16.12 20 14.23 20 12C20 9.77 19.23 7.88 17.68 6.33C16.12 4.78 